  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
    "value": "Basic Training"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 0^reset;\n\nYour training, thanks to four years in the Protectorate Academy, provides you with basic survival skills to keep you alive for extended periods in the event of a crash."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing1/0",
    "value": "Plant Fibre Sewing"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned the basics of sewing and can now create simple articles out of woven plant fibre."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion1/0",
    "value": "Simple Fashion"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nBy applying your knowledge of sewing, you can now make many simple fashionable items out of plant fibre fabric."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing2/0",
    "value": "Cotton Sewing"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYour sewing skill has improved. You are now able to spin cotton into usable wool for use in all sorts of stuff."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion2/0",
    "value": "Advanced Fashion"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've become quite knowledgeable about galactic fashion trends and can make better cotton-based clothing to spice up your appearance."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing3/0",
    "value": "Silk Sewing"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou now have the talent to weave silk into sheets used for crafting advanced armors and furniture."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion3/0",
    "value": "Fashion Mastery"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nSo great is your artistry with fashionable clothing creation that you can make beautiful gowns that are sure to get you a discount when trading goods with space stations by virtue of your sheer magnificence."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing4a/0",
    "value": "Synthetic Fabrics"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing4a/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nNot just limited to natural threads, you can weave fabrics out of inorganic materials. You are now able to create a synthetic material which is as durable as kevlar, but far more comfortable to wear."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing4b/0",
    "value": "Mutavisk Sewing"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing4b/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nMutavisk is the hardest natural fibre to weave, but you've figured out how by applying fungal ichor during the weaving process. You can now spin Bio-Thread, which, in addition to being exquisitely beautiful, is incredibly resistant to radiation."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing5/0",
    "value": "Peerless Sewing"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing5/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou've mastered the art of sewing. So great is your skill that you can weave the atom-thick Graphene into your synthetic material, creating a nearly indestructible cloth for use in the highest-quality armors available."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/cooking1/0",
    "value": "Culinary Arts"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/cooking1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou're learning to prepare something more complex than simple campfire food. You can now create a Kitchen Counter to prepare advanced dishes. You also learn quite a few basic recipes."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze1/0",
    "value": "Alcohol Creation"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nBrewing and winemaking are some pretty handy skills to know for an aspiring alcoholic. You can now dip your toes into the craft of booze-making. A word of warning, though - it's a complicated process. You may want to ask a master brewer at the ^orange;Science Outpost^reset; for advice.\n\n^yellow;Did you know?^reset; Frackin' Universe incorporated the beer-brewing system from the Starbooze mod way back in 2015!"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze2/0",
    "value": "Advanced Alcohols"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've become quite skilled at brewing. Such talent comes with benefits: you've put to paper some recipes for strange beverages that are sure to be the talk of connoisseurs across the galaxy."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze3/0",
    "value": "Brewing Mastery"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour mastery of alcohol is so great that you can make bizarre and esoteric brews with flavors that trascend reality in ways never seen before."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony1/0",
    "value": "Colony Creation"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've gained the skills needed to govern a large colony. You can now build a ^orange;Colony Station^reset; at your Inventor's Table, allowing you to craft several colony automation devices.\n\n^yellow;Colony System Guide^reset;: The basis of your colony is the Colony Core, a device which passively collects rent from (and only from) Mk2 Tenant Deeds, which generate no rent on their own - they are co-dependent.\n\nThe happier your tenants are, the more rent they will pay. Happiness can be increased by constructing various add-ons for your colony, which can also generate resources, doing so faster the more tenants you have. There is a limit of one of each add-on per colony."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/canvas/0",
    "value": "Canvas Creation"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/canvas/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've gotten pretty good at working with cotton. You can now spin cotton into durable and useful canvas sheets at your Sewing Machine."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/painting/0",
    "value": "Painting"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/painting/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've taken up the hobby of painting. With canvas as your... canvas, you can now create pretty decorative art pieces to hang around your lab.\n\nIf you delve into more...^cyan;unusual^reset; artistic pursuits, you'll find a whole new world of strangeness awaiting you."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony2/0",
    "value": "Improved Colonies"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou can make some more add-ons for your colony. You've also realized that your colonists might make perfect test subjects... who cares how happy they are if you're making good use of them?"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony3/0",
    "value": "Advanced Colonies"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've made some even more advanced colony add-ons, some of which may overstep some ethical bounds. People are a resource, after all!"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/cooking3/0",
    "value": "Bizarre Cooking"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/cooking3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou're not satisfied with just 'edible' or 'tasty' food ingredients. You've made some home recipes for meals that could be charitably called experimental."
  },
