  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/workbenchpeglaci/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nLong ago, the Peglaci were a race of arctic carnivores, the apex predators of their world, until they were uplifted by a race they know only as the Wanderers. You've learned to replicate their unique crafting style, a mix of ice and lignin developed in their race's infancy and metallically augmented by gifted knkowledge."
