    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've picked up the ancient Peglaci art of snow-sculpting, developed on their homeworld aeons ago and practiced even still across all levels of their society.\n\n^cyan;The Snowprinter can be found at the Inventor's Table.^reset;"
